{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>Six hundred thousand on foot.</b> There is no need to mention the minors. Many have interpreted this passage for many reasons. Some say that Moses stated what Israel would say to him when they ask what the meat is, and the response he would say to them: you have no need to ask — <b>Is the hand of YHWH shortened?</b> And I do not know the reason for this difficulty. Rather, the matter is as it sounds: Moses did not know that HaShem would create a sign or wonder except to vindicate His prophet, as I shall explain:"], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:17:14.996247700Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}